  "prediction": "The meeting discussed various topics including the transcription status, participant approval, DARPA demo status, disk issues, and the Transcriber interface. The group also discussed the upcoming meeting and the need to have a list of what has been done so far. Additionally, they talked about the recognition system, the Hub-five system, and the tandem system, and made plans to combine the SRI system with the ICSI system. The meeting also touched on the issue of disk space and the need to expand the storage capacity.",
